  "_about": "The anchor registry (issue #2809). Each anchor is a well-known count a reader already feels. checked is the date a person last read the source. pick.js picks only status verified; a volatile anchor is skipped 180 days after its newest checked date. Excluded anchors stay here with the reason, so nobody adds them again. Seeded from .scratch/anchor-callouts/anchors.seed.json.",
